here, from the fact

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:42.355
that they were able

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:44.357
to secure her release,

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:45.458
you know, in exchange

00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:47.593
for a notorious arms dealer,

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:48.661
Viktor Bout

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.029
anything that could help with

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:51.097
securing Paul's release?

00:08:52.832 --> 00:08:53.332
I certainly

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:54.166
hope so,

00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:54.634
because

00:08:54.634 --> 00:08:55.434
Paul has been waiting

00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.203
for a very long time

00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:57.737
You know,

00:08:57.737 --> 00:08:58.271
he sat through

00:08:58.271 --> 00:08:59.739
the previous administration

00:08:59.739 --> 00:09:01.173
and now this one

00:09:01.173 --> 00:09:02.775
watching other people go home.

00:09:02.775 --> 00:09:04.377
I can't imagine what his life is

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.878
like day to day

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:06.612
in the prison

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:08.447
the resolve that he is showing.

00:09:08.447 --> 00:09:10.850
But how long will that resolve last?

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.785
And I'm hoping that people

00:09:12.785 --> 00:09:14.854
are feeling a greater sense of urgency

00:09:14.887 --> 00:09:17.089
to solve this problem. And get him home.

00:09:17.523 --> 00:09:19.058
Elizabeth, I'm curious

00:09:19.058 --> 00:09:20.192
whether in your conversations

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:20.960
with the U.S.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.961
government,

00:09:22.194 --> 00:09:23.129
have they ever talk to you

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:24.063
about why

00:09:24.063 --> 00:09:25.531
they think it has been harder

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:27.633
to secure his release?

00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:28.100
You know why?

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:28.901
Others, you point out

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:30.136
he's been there so much longer

00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.203
than so many others. Right.

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:32.672
And that and others come and others

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:34.941
go and swaps happen. And yet not him.

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:37.443
Yeah.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:37.810
I mean,

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:38.277
really, from

00:09:38.277 --> 00:09:40.546
the start, the FSB set Paul up.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:43.316
They gave him a USB drive

00:09:43.316 --> 00:09:45.418
and then arrested him 5 minutes later.

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.420
Saying that the USB drive contains

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.421
state secrets.

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:49.589
And from that point on,

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:51.457
they held him for 18 months

00:09:51.457 --> 00:09:54.026
before TiVo prison in pretrial detention,

00:09:54.026 --> 00:09:55.461
then had a sham trial

00:09:55.461 --> 00:09:56.262
and sent him

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:56.996
sentenced him

00:09:56.996 --> 00:09:59.131
to six years for this, quote,

00:09:59.131 --> 00:10:00.433
unquote, espionage.

00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:02.201
And so ever since then, they have

00:10:02.201 --> 00:10:04.203
this is a Russian fairy tale,

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:05.404
and they have decided that

00:10:05.404 --> 00:10:07.740
because of this, quote unquote value

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.407
Paul has, that

00:10:08.407 --> 00:10:09.542
they should be able to ask

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:12.545
for something big in return.

00:10:12.578 --> 00:10:15.648
And do you have any more or less hope

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:16.716
tonight, Elizabeth,

00:10:16.716 --> 00:10:17.917
after the Greiner swap

00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:19.952
that Paul will be home soon?

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.187
And I use that word soon.

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:22.088
I know it's

00:10:22.254 --> 00:10:23.756
undefinable, but

00:10:23.756 --> 00:10:24.423
do you have more

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:25.491
hope or less hope tonight?

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:30.229
It really hasn't changed

00:10:30.229 --> 00:10:31.063
to a certain extent

00:10:31.063 --> 00:10:32.865
because Trevor and Paul,

00:10:32.865 --> 00:10:34.100
Trevor and Britney's

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.435
situations were treated differently.

00:10:36.435 --> 00:10:39.005
That still left the situation with Paul.

00:10:39.005 --> 00:10:42.074
And how is that going to get resolved?

00:10:42.675 --> 00:10:44.910
I do know that I will be bearing down

00:10:45.411 --> 00:10:47.546
much more with much more pressure

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.215
on the people I've been working with

00:10:49.215 --> 00:10:50.049
because I don't want to

00:10:50.049 --> 00:10:50.983
see this happen again.

